<title>USA: PanAmSat to run Fox Kids in Latin America.</title>
<headline>PanAmSat to run Fox Kids in Latin America.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>PanAmSat Corp said it will transmit a second Fox television channel, Fox Kids Network Worldwide, to Latin America on its PAS-3 satellite.</p>
<p>PanAmSat currently transmits another channel, Fox Canal.</p>
<p>Fox Kids, part of News Corp, filed for an initial public offering of common stock in September 1996. It produces shows including &quot;Mighty Morphin Power Rangers&quot;, &quot;Goosebumps&quot;, &quot;Casper the Friendly Ghost&quot;, &quot;Spiderman&quot; and &quot;The Adventures of Batman and Robin&quot;.</p>
</text>
